# Intentionally tracked despite *.keystore above - see the comment on it in
# app/build.gradle.kts: a fixed, non-secret, shared signing key so every CI
# build (and every dev's local debug build) produces installable-as-an-update
# APKs instead of a fresh random one per machine.
!ci-debug.keystore

# p2p-go (M4): the gomobile .aar lands under p2p-go/build/, already covered by
